---
import { principles } from '../data/profile';
import Terminal from './Terminal.astro';

interface Props {
  headless?: boolean;
}

const { headless = false } = Astro.props;
---

<section id="about" class:list={{ 'about-embedded': headless }}>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <aside class="about-left fade-up" aria-label="Identity">
        <div class="about-symbol" aria-hidden="true">M<span>.</span></div>

        <div class="about-identities">
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Tamil-Canadian</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Born Toronto, raised Markham</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Tamil · English · French</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Anime &amp; Japanese culture</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>DJ · after hours</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Elden Ring · Wukong</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Lifeguard &amp; aquatics leader</div>
          <div class="identity"><span class="identity-dot"></span>Competitor at heart</div>
        </div>

        <div class="symbol-row">
          <div class="symbol-item">
            <span class="sym" lang="ja">月</span>
            <span class="sym-label">mathee<br />= moon</span>
          </div>
          <div class="symbol-item">
            <span class="sym" lang="ja">龍</span>
            <span class="sym-label">year of<br />the dragon</span>
          </div>
          <div class="symbol-item">
            <span class="sym" lang="ja">波</span>
            <span class="sym-label">varuna<br />waves</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="about-coord mono">43.8561° N · 79.3370° W<br />markham, ontario</p>
      </aside>

      <div class="about-right">
        {!headless && (
          <>
            <p class="section-label">about</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">Behind the <em>prompt</em></h2>
          </>
        )}

        <div class="about-bio">
          <p>
            I grew up in <strong>Markham</strong> — one of Canada’s most multicultural cities — the son of
            Tamil parents from Sri Lanka. My first language was Tamil. I picked up English, then French
            through school. I grew up surrounded by Japanese anime, Chinese New Year, and every cuisine
            you can imagine. That breadth shaped how I think.
          </p>
          <p>
            My name, <em>Matheesan</em>, means moon in Tamil — <em>mathee</em> (<span class="tamil" lang="ta">மதி</span>). I’ve always felt a pull
            toward water: lifeguard at 16, aquatics programs, awards through the Life Saving Society. My son
            was born in the year of the dragon and named after Varuna — the Hindu lord of storms and waves.
            The symbols chose us as much as we chose them.
          </p>
          <p>
            Music and games are the other two languages. I DJ — house, disco, ambient, Tamil, whatever
            the room needs — and I keep a rotation of <em>Elden Ring</em>, <em>Wukong</em>, <em>Mario Kart</em>,
            <em>Valorant</em> and <em>Overwatch</em>. Both are about pattern, timing and losing gracefully
            until the next attempt.
          </p>
          <p>
            Engineering became the arena: complex problems, no obvious answers, no ceiling on how good you
            can get. My final-year ML project — Twitter data into interaction graphs into community structure
            — was the first time a model found something I hadn’t. Later I was putting LLM agents
            in front of real callers and learning that the interesting part is not the demo. It’s the gap
            between <strong>“the tests are green”</strong> and <strong>“it works on a real call.”</strong>
          </p>
          <p>
            I’m genuinely optimistic about AI, and specific about it. I’m a software engineer first — the
            tooling is a multiplier, not a substitute for the craft. The work I care about is not replacing
            judgment; it’s making judgment legible, testable, and safe enough to automate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 class="sr-only">Operating principles</h2>

        <div class="principles fade-up" aria-label="Operating principles">
          {principles.map((principle, index) => (
            <div class="principle">
              <span class="principle-num mono">0{index + 1}</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="principle-key">{principle.key}</h3>
                <p class="principle-body">{principle.body}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="terminal-wrap fade-up">
      <div class="terminal-head">
        <span class="mono">~/matheesan — interactive shell</span>
        <span class="mono terminal-head-note">read-only · no production access · yes, it is real</span>
      </div>
      <Terminal />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about { background: var(--bg2); }
  .about-embedded { padding-top: 2.5rem; }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.78fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-left {
    position: sticky;
    top: 6rem;
  }

  .about-symbol {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 8rem;
    line-height: 0.8;
    color: var(--wave1);
    margin-bottom: 2.2rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .about-symbol span { color: var(--gold); }

  .about-identities {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .identity {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--text2);
  }

  .identity-dot {
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .symbol-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.8rem;
    margin-top: 2.2rem;
    padding-top: 1.8rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .symbol-item { text-align: center; }

  .symbol-item .sym {
    font-family: var(--jp);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .symbol-item .sym-label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text3);
  }

  .about-coord {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--text3);
  }

  .about-bio p {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 1.18rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: var(--text2);
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }

  .about-bio p:first-child { color: var(--text1); }

  .about-bio strong { font-weight: 500; color: var(--moon); }
  .about-bio em { font-style: italic; color: var(--moon2); }
  .about-bio .tamil { font-family: var(--tamil); font-style: normal; font-size: 0.92em; color: var(--moon2); }

  .principles {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-top: 2.4rem;
  }

  .principle {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--bg2);
    padding: 1.2rem 1.1rem;
    transition: background 0.25s;
  }

  .principle:hover { background: var(--bg3); }

  .principle-num {
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .principle-key {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text1);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .principle-body {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text2);
  }

  .terminal-wrap { margin-top: 5rem; }

  .terminal-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .terminal-head .mono { font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--accent); }
  .terminal-head-note { color: var(--text3) !important; font-size: 0.52rem !important; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
    .about-left { position: static; }
    .about-symbol { font-size: 5.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
    .about-identities { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .about-coord { display: none; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .about-identities { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .terminal-head { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }
    .symbol-row { gap: 1.2rem; }
  }
</style>
